  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help us build PawzUp, first cage free shelter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First cage-free shelter from Romania projected to bring people and animals together and allow them to help one another and enjoy each other&apos;s company. Why PawzUp? Because we always dream for a better place for animals and also, because both animals and people in Romania needs this project completed as a legacy for the generations that come after us.  The total estimated cost to build entire PawzUp exceeds 5 milion dollars but initially we fundraise for the first building, the dog shelter.</narrative>
  </description>
